world  ten falling dominoes

floor
  size      3 m
  friction  0.9, spinning 0.001, rolling 0.0001

domino
  is a             box 1 by 4 by 10 cm, 60 g
  moves            freely
  stands           on floor
  friction         0.9, spinning 0.001, rolling 0.0001
  bounce           dead
  colour           wood
  repeated         10 times, 3 cm apart along
  first one spins  10 rad/s about y
